   "accessed": "2026-10-11",
   "quote": "Original registration/renewal $76* ... Includes the Alternative Fuel/Technology Fee ($3) ... RIF ... $121 ... Vehicle Value $5,000-$24,999 VR Fee Increase $66"
  },
  "dmv-vlf": {
   "name": "California DMV, Vehicle Industry Registration Procedures Manual, Vehicle License Fee, and VLF Rate Table REG 360",
   "url": "https://www.dmv.ca.gov/portal/handbook/vehicle-industry-registration-procedures-manual-2/collection-and-payment-of-fees-and-penalties/vehicle-license-fee/",
   "accessed": "2026-10-11",
   "quote": "After 1/1/05 is .65 percent of the market value of the vehicle. The market value of a vehicle is depreciated for each registration year of its life in accordance with the 11th year depreciation schedule"
  },
  "dmv-county": {
